 driver.close()
 ```
 
+### Stream endpoint discovery
+
+Set `'ydb.sdk.enable_eds': true` to subscribe to endpoint changes over the driver's bootstrap connection. The driver uses periodic discovery when a server reports that EDS is unimplemented and periodically probes for support. New calls use the installed assignment while calls already in flight finish on their original channels. Bridge pile preferences apply to streamed assignments.
+
 ### Closing the driver
 
 `using driver = new Driver(...)` and `driver.close()` immediately cancel active RPCs and close all connections, with or without discovery. The driver has no asynchronous disposal or shutdown grace period.
